# Nissan Micra K11 three-door hatchback, 1992-2003.
#
# The K11 Micra: 3,720 mm long, 1,585 mm wide, 1,430 mm high, 2,360 mm
# wheelbase; 1.0-1.4 petrol and a 1.5 diesel. European Car of the Year 1993 and a
# strong British seller; built at Sunderland from 1993.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Micra
#
# Colours: White, Red, Blue and Green are documented Nissan colours of the period.
#
# Weight: 180 in total (white 55, red 45, blue 45, green 35).
#
# Speed 150 km/h; comfort 75/443 (line). Classes 0,1.
# Dates: 1992-2003 with a road tail to about 2011.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-micra.blend. References:
# citycars/references/nissan-micra/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

